/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 323.30 Tm (`hal.scheduler`.) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 311.80 Tm (- `Linux::Scheduler` implements the platform scheduler interface, `AP_HAL::Scheduler`.) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 300.30 Tm (- `AP_Vehicle` owns or accesses the vehicle-level `AP_Scheduler`.) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 288.80 Tm (- `Rover.cpp` defines `Rover::scheduler_tasks[]`; `AP_Scheduler::loop\(\)` runs those ) Tj
