/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 788.50 Tm (The loop that drives this task table is in `AP_Vehicle::loop\(\)`, not in `Rover.cpp`:) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 777.00 Tm () Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 765.50 Tm () Tj
/F3 7.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 760.50 Tm (void AP_Vehicle::loop\(\)) Tj
